{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bike Stunts Simulator is a thrilling physics-based ride where you\u2019ll feel the rush of speeding through hoops, landing tricky jumps, and dodging spikes and traps\u2014all while trying to stay balanced and avoid wiping out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/extras/18fa328f94776fab4df895bc07db9c7b.poster.avif?t=1772546537\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/extras/18fa328f94776fab4df895bc07db9c7b.webm?t=1772546537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/extras/18fa328f94776fab4df895bc07db9c7b.mp4?t=1772546537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Bike Stunts Simulator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bike Stunts Simulator features 27 handcrafted levels across 3 unique worlds, each packed with puzzles, traps, and obstacles. Speed through hoops, dodge spikes, and survive collapsing paths and moving platforms without tipping over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/extras/917d8e02fc5e9266720ae5bf0df8a7a5.poster.avif?t=1772546537\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/extras/917d8e02fc5e9266720ae5bf0df8a7a5.webm?t=1772546537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/extras/917d8e02fc5e9266720ae5bf0df8a7a5.mp4?t=1772546537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 different bike models, each with distinct handling. Face swinging hammers, rotating beams, impossible jumps, and narrow ramps in a physics-based challenge that tests your balance, reflexes, and nerves.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933100?t=1772546537","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933100?t=1772546537","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/dec933a8594614ada6869f6d0074669e42a6cc93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772546537","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/dec933a8594614ada6869f6d0074669e42a6cc93/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772546537","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Bike Stunts Simulator</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/extras/df8b3a6e4809ef3adcfa4b2f74600849.avif?t=1772546537\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bike Stunts Simulator is a thrilling physics-based ride where you\u2019ll feel the rush of speeding through hoops, landing tricky jumps, and dodging spikes and traps\u2014all while trying to stay balanced and avoid wiping out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/extras/18fa328f94776fab4df895bc07db9c7b.poster.avif?t=1772546537\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933100/extras/18fa328f94776fab4df895bc07db9c7b